# Versions that have been uploaded to Aminet and MorphOS Storage.
#
# `make dist` refuses to build any version listed here. Once a version is on
# those sites, every later change needs a NEW version: re-uploading different
# contents under the same number leaves the sites, and anyone who downloaded
# it, unable to tell the two apart.
#
# To reproduce a released package exactly, check out its commit and build
# there -- this file does not exist at that commit, so the guard does not fire.
# Rebuilding an old version from a newer tree is precisely what this prevents.
# `make dist` also refuses an uncommitted tree, so from 1.1 on a release
# always corresponds to exactly one commit.
#
# version  commit   date        archive sha256
